## Key Findings & Blockers

### 1. Critical Store Blockers
1. **Missing External HTTPS Privacy Policy URL (`S11-019` — CRITICAL):**
   - Google Play policy requires a publicly accessible HTTPS Privacy Policy URL on an active domain.
   - While [LegalScreen.tsx](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/src/screens/LegalScreen.tsx#L234-L342) contains complete, accurate in-app privacy disclosures, no public HTTPS URL is configured or hosted (docs note dev HTTP IP `http://38.60.176.137:9998`).
2. **Missing Play Store Feature Graphic (`S11-022` — HIGH):**
   - Google Play mandates a `1024×500` PNG/JPEG feature graphic; none exists in the repository (noted as pending in [docs/publishing.md](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/docs/publishing.md#L102)).
   - Tablet screenshots (7-inch and 10-inch) are also missing.
3. **Unimplemented Android Widget Claim (`S11-021` — MEDIUM):**
   - [README.md](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/README.md#L51) and [docs/publishing.md](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/docs/publishing.md#L98) claim "Home-screen widgets (Android)", but neither [AndroidManifest.xml](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml) nor the merged release manifest contains an `AppWidgetProvider`.
4. **Missing `android.versionCode` in `app.json` (`S11-002` — MEDIUM):**
   - `versionCode 89` is set in [android/app/build.gradle](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/android/app/build.gradle#L103), but omitted in [app.json](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/app.json). If `expo prebuild` is ever executed, it risks regenerating Gradle with default `versionCode 1`.

### 2. High-Assurance Passing Areas
- **Package ID & Signing (Rule 3):** `com.qashi.islamic` is preserved across all configs. Production keystore (`CN=Ceoslugpk, OU=Islamic App`) with SHA-256 certificate valid to 2054 is present and verified.
- **Target API & 64-bit Architecture:** `targetSdkVersion: 36` (exceeds Google Play requirement of API ≥ 34) and `reactNativeArchitectures` includes `arm64-v8a` and `x86_64`.
- **Hermes & New Architecture:** Hermes bytecode engine is active (`libhermesvm.so` and precompiled JS bundle in AAB/APK).
- **Network Security:** 100% of runtime API endpoints in `src/` use HTTPS; `usesCleartextTraffic` is strictly false in release manifest.
- **Unwanted Permission Pruning:** [plugins/withRemoveActivityRecognition.js](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/plugins/withRemoveActivityRecognition.js) successfully strips `ACTIVITY_RECOGNITION`, `RECORD_AUDIO`, and `SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW` at manifest merge time.
- **Data Safety Alignment:** Zero accounts, zero ads, zero analytics SDKs; Women's Worship data is strictly confined to on-device SQLite.

